# TerraMove Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# Production (e.g. Vercel deployment):
# Configure your backend API endpoint. Both forms are supported:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://terramove.onrender.com
# -or-
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://terramove.onrender.com/api/v1
#
# Note: If VITE_API_BASE_URL is not set in production, the application
# automatically falls back to: https://terramove.onrender.com/api/v1
#
# Development:
# Leave empty to route via Vite dev server proxy to localhost:8001

